<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Southcorp half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Southcorp half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  103.01 vs  92.15</p>
<p>    Net profit			   64.92 vs  53.09</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    8.25 vs   8.25</p>
<p>NOTE: Southcorp Holdings Ltd is a vintner and appliance manufacturer.</p>
